      "sections": [
        {
          "number": 7,
          "title": "往岁乘霄醒惊蛰",
          "act": "第七幕",
          "notes": [
            "《行路遇新知》的前置是上一幕任务 `140800000` 的子任务 `330`。"
          ],
          "tasks": [
            {
              "sequence": 16,
              "quest_id": 146000002,
              "title": "眠龙庭",
              "reading_status": "ordered_draft_with_gaps",
              "notes": [
                "【已定位的正文按章节回顾排列】",
                "【部分流程或交互暂略，详情见同名JSON】",
                "【玩法局部片段列在后面，具体位置待确认】"
              ],
              "events": [
                {
                  "sequence": 1,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "「曜纹」……",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_300_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 2,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "岁主是在提醒我们，找到与「曜纹」相应的三个「曜岩」，就能解除残星会设下的禁锢。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_300_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 3,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "可我没看到那些「曜岩」，也看不到其它房间的入口。",
                  "speaker_id": 354,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_300_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 4,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "水潭下似乎有东西……我们先从这里的「溯流仪」入手吧。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_300_4"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 5,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "水位下降了。",
                  "speaker_id": 354,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_305_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 6,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "露出的岸石上有「曜岩」！",
                  "speaker_id": 354,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_305_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 7,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "走吧，我们到「曜岩」那里去。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_305_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 8,
                  "kind": "omission",
                  "speaker": null,
                  "text": "【演出过程略】"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 9,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "无署名",
                  "text": "……",
                  "speaker_id": 83,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 10,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "这里说的“死婴”是……",
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_2",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_1_1_乘宵山主线_眠龙庭_1_7:1",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 11,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "对……是我……",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 12,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "自有记忆以来，我便一直生活在今州，然而这些事，我也曾听大家说起过。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_4"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 13,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "对于我来说，岁主不仅仅是岁主，或是高高在上的神祇，祂于我既有养育之情，也有再造之恩。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_5"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 14,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "这一路上，我思考了许多。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_6"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 15,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "倘若预言当真出自岁主之口，为什么祂会甘愿救下那个与祂注定有一战的孩子？",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_7"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 16,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "现在我明白了，因为我是岁主的共鸣者。我虽无逆转天地之力，却有着祂曾经拥有，却不慎损毁的那一环时序之法。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_8"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 17,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "如果日后，今州如乘霄山一般，陷于狂乱的时流之中，我……恐怕是唯一能逆转局势的人。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_9"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 18,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "……只不过在岁主的预想中，我与祂的一战，应该在遥远的未来。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_10"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 19,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "祂在等一个时机，等一个万事俱备的时机，因此这一切祂才迟迟不肯向我说明。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_11"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 20,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "但……就算如今不是岁主等待已久的良机，我的这幅身躯也已经残破不堪……",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_12"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 21,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "我亦要凭着这残躯走到祂面前……向祂亲口求证真相。或是，完成那命定的纷争。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_13"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 22,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "你也可以从这命运中逃开。",
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_14",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_1_1_乘宵山主线_眠龙庭_1_7:12",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 23,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "放弃使命么？我倒是从未想过……",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_16"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 24,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "可坦白说……我也并非没有过挣扎。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_17"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 25,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "我想，我之所以能走到今日，从来不是靠我一人。是长离老师、辛夷大人、你，还有今州的所有人，你们的善意，给了我勇气。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_18"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 26,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "甚至于我的重生……不论是不是源于对生命的怜悯，直到今天，我依然觉得那是个温暖而有力量的决定。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_19"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 27,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "今州是我的故乡，这里有我所珍视的全部，即便是要抛开令尹这层身份，我也做不到弃今州于不顾。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_20"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 28,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "可你的身体……",
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_21",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_1_1_乘宵山主线_眠龙庭_1_7:17",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 29,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "我没事……",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_22"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 30,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "和那些被卷入时间乱流的生灵比起来，我的这点痛苦算不得什么。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_23"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 31,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "而且，我必须去到岁主身前。我与祂的力量同源，救祂亦是在救我。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_24"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 32,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "你真的要完成与岁主的命定之战吗？",
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_25",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_1_1_乘宵山主线_眠龙庭_1_7:20",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 33,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "假如事情最终真的没有回转的余地……",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_26"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 34,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "若我不战，则今州必然覆灭。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_27"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 35,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "若我一战，不仅能保下岁主，还能保下今州。代价，只需我一人。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_28"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 36,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "能以此换得大家平安，舍我一身，也并不多可惜。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_29"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 37,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "更何况，我不是为求死而来，恰恰相反，我想要搏得那一丝可能，只要有一丝可能。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_30"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 38,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "这并非是必死之局，不是吗？",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_42"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 39,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "我相信你的决定。",
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_31",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_1_1_乘宵山主线_眠龙庭_1_7:26",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 40,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "能被你这样信任着，真好。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_33"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 41,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "回想起来，自从你来到今州，我的身边就多了很多很多幸运的事。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_34"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 42,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "谢谢你，漂泊者。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_35"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 43,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "我会一直和你站在一起。",
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_36",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_1_1_乘宵山主线_眠龙庭_1_7:29",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 44,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "长离老师说乘霄山之事，你我二人缺一不可。我自知岁主与你关系匪浅，所以，我的选择亦需要你的支持。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_39"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 45,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "不过别担心，我做好准备了。我并非被迫臣服于命运，而是自愿投入命运的洪流。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_40"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 46,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "这段路能和你同行，我很开心。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_360_41"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 47,
                  "kind": "scene_heading",
                  "speaker": null,
                  "text": "【按计数递增时的调用顺序排列，实际触发及整体位置待确认】"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 48,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "成功了。",
                  "speaker_id": 354,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_310_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 49,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "还有两个，我们先在近处找找。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_310_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 50,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "还剩下最后一个「曜岩」。",
                  "speaker_id": 354,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_365_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 51,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "这样的话……岁主应该可以脱困了。",
                  "speaker_id": 354,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_372_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 52,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "……嗯，应当没错。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_372_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 53,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "今汐",
                  "text": "我们先回去吧，到岁主那里。",
                  "speaker_id": 186,
                  "text_id": "Chengxiaoshan_main_1_1_372_3"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "source_chapter": "瑝珑 第一章",
